---
import HeroCreds from "../components/hw/HeroCreds.astro";
import Reviews from "../components/hw/Reviews.astro";
import Base from "../layouts/Base.astro";
import Header from "../components/Header.astro";
import Footer from "../components/Footer.astro";
import Icon from "../components/Icon.astro";
import MediaStrip from "../components/MediaStrip.astro";
import "../styles/pages/about.css";
import "../styles/pages/hubs.css";
import VideoCarousel from "../components/hw/VideoCarousel.astro";
import ClosingCta from "../components/hw/ClosingCta.astro";
import Insurance from "../components/hw/Insurance.astro";
import { VIDEOS, PODCAST, STORIES } from "../data/videos.js";
import Locations from "../components/hw/Locations.astro";
import { providers } from "../data/providers.js";
import { SITE, PHONE } from "../data/site.js";
import Prose from "../components/seo/Prose.astro";
import Faq from "../components/hw/Faq.astro";
import "../styles/pages/seo.css";
const POSTERS = { "uDy-K1dO0Fw": "news-ct-live-trauma-in-women", "GJeVqHhooBA": "news-wfsb-helping-children", "P3cmQMf3WoM": "news-teen-mental-health", "aff5Xfy9CfE": "loneliness-crisis" };
// Long-form SEO copy (2026-11-16). Primary keyword: "Hopewell Health Solutions in the news"; variants: Connecticut
// mental health expert interviews, Dr. Kristine Schlichting media. Facts only from each feature's headline/outlet.
const blocks = [
  { id: "in-the-news", h2: "Hopewell Health Solutions in the news",
    paras: [
      `Connecticut reporters and TV producers regularly ask Hopewell Health Solutions clinicians to explain what is happening in mental health and what families can do about it. Our team has appeared on WFSB Eyewitness News 3, NBC Connecticut’s CT Live!, FOX61 and Great Day Connecticut, and the practice has been covered by the Hartford Courant and the Hartford Business Journal.`,
      `The topics reflect the work we do every day: <a class="inl" href="/programs/teen-iop/">teen mental health</a>, <a class="inl" href="/programs/womens-wellness-iop/">women’s mental health</a> and trauma, support for new moms, and the role of intensive outpatient care in Connecticut. Each segment and article on this page links to the original source, and you can watch the TV interviews right here.`,
      `If you saw one of our clinicians on the news and want to talk to someone about yourself or a loved one, our <a class="inl" href="/admissions/">admissions team</a> can help you find the right next step, from <a class="inl" href="/programs/counseling/">counseling</a> to an <a class="inl" href="/programs/intensive-outpatient-program/">intensive outpatient program</a>.`,
    ],
    aside: { type: "points", title: "Where you’ve seen us", items: [["play", "WFSB Eyewitness News 3"], ["play", "NBC Connecticut · CT Live!"], ["play", "FOX61"], ["clipboard", "Hartford Courant"], ["clipboard", "Hartford Business Journal"]] } },
  { id: "iop-clinic", h2: "Hartford Courant: Glastonbury’s first privately owned IOP clinic",
    paras: [
      `In February 2023, the Hartford Courant covered the opening of Hopewell as the first privately owned IOP mental health clinic in Glastonbury. The story marked a step in the practice’s growth from outpatient therapy and psychiatry into structured intensive programs.`,
      `Today those programs include the <a class="inl" href="/programs/adult-mental-health-iop/">Adult Mental Health IOP</a>, the <a class="inl" href="/programs/womens-wellness-iop/">Women’s Wellness IOP</a>, the <a class="inl" href="/programs/teen-iop/">Teen &amp; Tween IOP</a>, the <a class="inl" href="/programs/first-responder-iop/">First Responder IOP</a> and a <a class="inl" href="/programs/partial-hospitalization-program/">partial hospitalization program</a>, across <a class="inl" href="/locations/">six Connecticut offices</a>.`,
    ],
    aside: { type: "img", src: "/Assets/hhs-2026/iop-group-room-lights.webp", alt: "An IOP group room at Hopewell Health Solutions in Glastonbury", cap: "An IOP group room in Glastonbury" } },
  { id: "dr-k", h2: "Dr. Kristine Schlichting in the media",
    paras: [
      `Hopewell’s founder and director, <a class="inl" href="/provider/kristine-a-schlichting-ph-d/">Dr. Kristine Schlichting</a>, was recognized by the Hartford Business Journal as a leader in behavioral health. A licensed psychologist, she has “broken the box” of traditional talk therapy to build a model of active, dynamic care grounded in neuroscience.`,
      `She has appeared on WFSB’s Mommy Monday to talk about helping children with their mental health, on Great Day Connecticut to discuss the teen mental health crisis, and on NBC Connecticut’s CT Live! to explain why so many women carry trauma and how the right support helps. FOX61 featured her work helping teen girls and new moms find support.`,
      `Those conversations connect to our care for <a class="inl" href="/what-we-treat/trauma-ptsd/">trauma and PTSD</a>, our <a class="inl" href="/programs/womens-trauma-iop/">Women’s Trauma IOP</a> and our support for <a class="inl" href="/post/baby-blues-vs-postpartum-depression-how-to-tell-the-difference/">postpartum depression</a>.`,
    ],
    aside: { type: "img", src: "/Assets/hhs-2026/dr-k-hhs-sign.webp", alt: "Dr. Kristine Schlichting with a Hopewell Health Solutions banner", cap: "Dr. Kristine Schlichting, Founder & Director" } },
  { id: "women-trauma", h2: "NBC Connecticut CT Live!: trauma in women",
    paras: [
      `On NBC Connecticut’s CT Live!, our team discussed why so many women carry trauma and how the right support changes things. The segment is a clear, compassionate introduction to how trauma can show up in daily life, long after the events themselves, through <a class="inl" href="/what-we-treat/anxiety/">anxiety</a>, <a class="inl" href="/what-we-treat/depression/">low mood</a>, exhaustion or difficulty trusting others.`,
      `At Hopewell, women can heal in a women-only group in our <a class="inl" href="/programs/womens-trauma-iop/">Women’s Trauma IOP</a>, built around trauma and healing, with <a class="inl" href="/treatment-methods/emdr/">EMDR</a>, somatic approaches and trauma-focused CBT. The <a class="inl" href="/programs/womens-wellness-iop/">Women’s Wellness IOP</a> supports women dealing with burnout, anxiety, life transitions and postpartum changes, in morning and evening groups.`,
      `If you want to understand more first, read <a class="inl" href="/post/how-womens-trauma-differs-from-mens-and-how-group-therapy-supports-healing/">how women’s trauma differs from men’s and how group therapy helps</a>.`,
    ],
    aside: { type: "img", src: "/Assets/videos/news-ct-live-trauma-in-women.webp", alt: "CT Live! Trauma in Women segment poster", cap: "NBC Connecticut · CT Live!" } },
  { id: "teen-mental-health", h2: "Teen mental health on WFSB",
    paras: [
      `In February 2023, WFSB’s Kara’s Cures featured Hopewell in two segments: one on the teen mental health crisis and one on <a class="inl" href="/admissions/for-families/">how parents can help</a> improve their teen’s mental health. Both are practical, parent-facing conversations about what to watch for and how to respond.`,
      `For parents who want to go further, our free <a class="inl" href="/handouts/">mental health handouts</a> cover anxiety, school refusal and self-harm, and our blog explains <a class="inl" href="/post/how-the-world-of-social-media-affects-teens/">how social media affects teens</a> and <a class="inl" href="/post/guide-to-teen-counseling-navigating-challenges-and-promoting-mental-health/">what teen counseling involves</a>.`,
    ] },
  { id: "why-media", h2: "Why our clinicians talk to Connecticut media",
    paras: [
      `Most people never see the inside of a therapy room or an intensive program until they need one. When our clinicians speak on the news, the goal is simple: to give people accurate, practical information about mental health, and to make it a little easier to ask for help.`,
      `That same goal drives our <a class="inl" href="/blog/">blog</a>, our free <a class="inl" href="/handouts/">handouts for parents and kids</a> and the <a class="inl" href="/podcast/">Hope, Health &amp; Healing podcast</a>. Every piece is written or reviewed by Hopewell clinicians, so what you read and watch reflects how we actually care for people across our six Connecticut offices.`,
    ] },
  { id: "holistic", h2: "Holistic psychology and spiritual care",
    paras: [
      `IssueWire featured <a class="inl" href="/provider/bido-aguessy-psy-d-lpc-a/">Dr. Bido Aguessy</a>, a clinical psychologist and spiritual care specialist at Hopewell, for holistic approaches in psychology and spiritual care. It reflects a wider part of how we work: alongside evidence-based therapies like <a class="inl" href="/treatment-methods/dbt/">DBT</a> and <a class="inl" href="/treatment-methods/emdr/">EMDR</a>, our team offers mind-body approaches such as mindfulness and yoga therapy.`,
      `You can read more about those methods on our <a class="inl" href="/treatment-methods/therapeutic-treatments/">therapeutic treatments</a> page.`,
    ] },
];
// FAQ: brief questions first (brief answer, then the live answer where the question already existed).
// Left out ([confirm] in the brief): response time, patient-interview policy beyond "we never share", podcast
// description FAQ, platforms other than YouTube, podcast topic/guest suggestions.
const EMAIL = "hhs4help@gmail.com";
const faqs = [
  ["How can journalists contact Hopewell?", `<p>Email <a class="inl" href="mailto:${EMAIL}">${EMAIL}</a> or use the <a class="inl" href="#press-contact">press contact details on this page</a>.</p> <p>Call <a class="inl" href="tel:8607351448">(860) 735-1448</a> and ask for a media contact.</p>`],
  ["What topics can your experts speak on?", `Adult and teen mental health, addiction and <a class="inl" href="/what-we-treat/co-occurring/">co-occurring disorders</a>, women’s mental health and postpartum care, first responder stress, <a class="inl" href="/what-we-treat/adhd/">ADHD</a>, and access to outpatient care in Connecticut.`],
  ["Can I interview a clinician for a story?", "Yes. Tell us your topic and deadline, and we’ll match you with the right clinician."],
  ["Can I interview a patient?", "We never share patient information."],
  ["Where can I find Hopewell’s logo and photos?", `In the <a class="inl" href="#media-kit">media kit on this page</a>. Please use the files as provided.`],
  ["Where has Hopewell Health Solutions been featured?", "On WFSB Eyewitness News 3, NBC Connecticut (CT Live!), FOX61 and Great Day Connecticut, and in the Hartford Courant, the Hartford Business Journal and IssueWire."],
  ["Who are Hopewell’s media spokespeople?", `Most interviews feature our founder and director, <a class="inl" href="/provider/kristine-a-schlichting-ph-d/">Dr. Kristine Schlichting</a>. Other clinicians contribute videos and articles on the <a class="inl" href="/blog/">Hopewell blog</a>.`],
  ["Does Hopewell have a podcast?", `Yes. <a class="inl" href="/podcast/">Hope, Health &amp; Healing</a> shares real stories of treatment and recovery, hosted by TJ Aitken, CPSRP.`],
  ["Where can I listen?", `On this page and on the <a class="inl" href="https://www.youtube.com/@hopewellhealthsolutions2285" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Hopewell Health Solutions YouTube channel</a>.`],
  ["Is podcast content medical advice?", `No. Episodes are for general education. If you need care, contact our <a class="inl" href="/admissions/">admissions team</a>; in a crisis, call or text <a class="inl" href="tel:988">988</a>.`],
  ["I saw a segment and want help. Where do I start?", `Call us or request a confidential callback. We’ll <a class="inl" href="/rates-and-insurance-coverage/">verify your insurance for free</a> and recommend a starting level of care. See <a class="inl" href="/admissions/">how admissions works</a>.`],
  ["Can I share these videos?", "Yes. The TV segments link to the original outlets and our own videos are on the Hopewell Health Solutions YouTube channel."],
];

const videos = [
  { id: "aff5Xfy9CfE", t: "The Loneliness Crisis in Adults", outlet: "Hopewell Health Solutions" },
  { id: "GJeVqHhooBA", t: "Mommy Monday: Helping Children", outlet: "WFSB Channel 3" },
  { id: "uDy-K1dO0Fw", t: "CT Live!: Trauma in Women", outlet: "NBC Connecticut" },
  { id: "P3cmQMf3WoM", t: "Teen Mental Health Interview", outlet: "WFSB Channel 3" },
];
const L = "/Assets/Media%20Appearances/";
const press = [
  { outlet: "Hartford Courant", logo: L + "hartford.webp", date: "Feb 2023", title: "Hopewell opens first privately owned IOP mental health clinic in Glastonbury", href: "https://www.courant.com/2023/02/24/hopewell-solutions-opens-first-privately-owned-iop-mental-health-clinic-in-glastonbury/" },
  { outlet: "Hartford Business Journal", logo: L + "hbj-logo-v3.webp", date: "Honoree", title: "Kristine Schlichting, recognized leader in behavioral health", who: "Dr. Kristine Schlichting", href: "https://hartfordbusiness.com/honoree/kristine-schlichting/" },
  { outlet: "FOX61", logo: L + "fox61.webp", date: "2023", title: "Glastonbury psychologist is helping teen girls and new moms find support", who: "Dr. Kristine Schlichting", href: "https://www.fox61.com/article/news/local/outreach/awareness-months/glastonbury-psychologist-is-helping-teen-girls-and-new-moms-find-support/520-84d3fd3f-1cec-40bc-9d4c-65f7b6a4d2e9" },
  { outlet: "WFSB · Kara’s Cures", logo: L + "wfsb.avif", date: "Feb 2023", title: "Teen mental health crisis", href: "https://www.wfsb.com/video/2023/02/27/karas-cures-teen-mental-health-crisis/" },
  { outlet: "WFSB · Kara’s Cures", logo: L + "wfsb.avif", date: "Feb 2023", title: "How to help improve your teen’s mental health", href: "https://www.wfsb.com/video/2023/02/27/karas-cures-how-help-improve-your-teens-mental-health/" },
  { outlet: "IssueWire", logo: L + "issuewire.webp", date: "Feature", title: "Dr. Bido Aguessy: holistic approaches in psychology & spiritual care at Hopewell", who: "Dr. Bido Aguessy", href: "https://www.issuewire.com/dr-bido-aguessy-pioneering-holistic-approaches-in-psychology-and-spiritual-care-at-hopewell-health-solutions-1809193551604743" },
];
const more = VIDEOS.filter((v) => v.yt !== "aff5Xfy9CfE" && (v.type.startsWith("Podcast") || v.type.startsWith("Clinician")));

// "As featured in": only outlets with a live, linked piece (WOUB in the shared strip has no linked piece here, so it's left out).
const featured = [
  ["Hartford Courant", L + "hartford.webp", press[0].href],
  ["Hartford Business Journal", L + "hbj-logo-v3.webp", press[1].href],
  ["FOX61", L + "fox61.webp", press[2].href],
  ["WFSB Eyewitness News 3", L + "wfsb.avif", press[3].href],
  ["NBC Connecticut", L + "nbc-connecticut.webp", "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=uDy-K1dO0Fw"],
  ["IssueWire", L + "issuewire.webp", press[5].href],
];
const latest = PODCAST[0];
const guestOf = (v) => v.name.replace(/’s story$/, "");
// Our experts: clinicians who have spoken for Hopewell on TV, in print, on the podcast or in our videos. Topics come from those appearances.
const experts = [
  ["kristine-a-schlichting-ph-d", "Teen mental health, women’s trauma, children’s mental health, loneliness and group therapy"],
  ["bido-aguessy-psy-d-lpc-a", "Holistic psychology and spiritual care"],
  ["tj-aitken-cpsrp", "Addiction recovery and peer support; host of the podcast"],
  ["viviana-alvarado-lpc-a", "Supporting neurodivergent tweens; grounding skills"],
].map(([slug, topics]) => ({ p: providers.find((x) => x.slug === slug), topics })).filter((e) => e.p);
const kitLogos = [
  ["Wave logo, full color (SVG, vector)", "/Assets/logo/hopewell-wave-logo-color.svg"],
  ["Wave logo, white for dark backgrounds (SVG, vector)", "/Assets/logo/hopewell-wave-logo-white.svg"],
  ["Wave logo, full color (WebP)", "/Assets/logo/hopewell-wave-logo.webp"],
  ["HHS logo (SVG, vector)", "/Assets/logo/hopewell-hhs-logo.svg"],
  ["HHS logo, white (SVG, vector)", "/Assets/logo/hopewell-hhs-logo-white.svg"],
];
const kitPhotos = [
  ["Dr. Kristine Schlichting headshot", "/Assets/Team%20Members/kristine-a-schlichting-phd.webp"],
  ["TJ Aitken headshot", "/Assets/Team%20Members/tj-aitken-cpsrp.webp"],
  ["The Hopewell team", "/Assets/hhs-2026/full-team-lawn.webp"],
  ["Downtown Glastonbury office", "/Assets/locations/downtown-glastonbury/entrance.webp"],
  ["Westbrook office", "/Assets/locations/westbrook/exterior.webp"],
];
const ldSeries = {
  "@context": "https://schema.org", "@type": "PodcastSeries", name: "Hope, Health & Healing", url: SITE + "/podcast/",
  description: "A Hopewell Health Solutions series sharing real stories of mental health treatment and recovery, hosted by TJ Aitken, CPSRP.",
  webFeed: "https://www.youtube.com/@hopewellhealthsolutions2285",
  hasPart: PODCAST.map((v, i) => ({ "@type": "PodcastEpisode", name: v.title, episodeNumber: PODCAST.length - i, datePublished: v.date, timeRequired: v.duration, url: `https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=${v.yt}`, description: v.desc })),
};
const ldPage = {
  "@context": "https://schema.org", "@type": "CollectionPage", name: "Hopewell in the Media", url: SITE + "/media/",
  about: { "@id": SITE + "/#organization" },
  mentions: press.map((p) => ({ "@type": "NewsArticle", headline: p.title, url: p.href, publisher: { "@type": "Organization", name: p.outlet } })),
  hasPart: experts.map(({ p }) => ({ "@type": "Person", name: p.name.split(",")[0].trim(), honorificSuffix: p.credentials, jobTitle: p.role, url: `${SITE}/provider/${p.slug}/` })),
};
// VideoObject schema comes from the VideoCarousel sections.
---

<Base title="Hopewell in the Media: Podcast, News & Experts | Hopewell" description="Listen to the Hopewell podcast, read our articles and press coverage, and contact our Connecticut mental health and addiction experts for interviews.">
  <Header />
  <script type="application/ld+json" set:html={JSON.stringify(ldPage)} />
  <script type="application/ld+json" set:html={JSON.stringify(ldSeries)} />
  <main class="hw">
    <!-- 1. Hero (navy hub hero). Coverage form sits lower on the page (#insurance). -->
    <section class="wq-hero">
      <div class="container wq-hero-grid md-hero-grid">
        <div>
          <nav class="wq-crumbs" aria-label="Breadcrumb"><a href="/">Home</a> / <span>Media</span></nav>
          <h1 class="text-balance">Hopewell in the Media</h1>
          <p class="lede">Our podcast, articles and expert commentary on mental health and addiction in Connecticut.</p>
          <p class="lede md-lede2">Connecticut’s news outlets turn to our clinicians for expertise on teen mental health, women’s wellness, and the future of outpatient care. Here’s where you’ve seen us.</p>
          <ul class="md-hero-list">
            {["WFSB Eyewitness News 3 &amp; NBC Connecticut", "FOX61 &amp; the Hartford Courant", "Hartford Business Journal", "The <a class='inl' href='/podcast/'>Hope, Health &amp; Healing podcast</a>"].map((b) => <li><span class="sv-tick"><Icon name="check" class="h-4 w-4" /></span><span set:html={b} /></li>)}
          </ul>
          <div class="wq-ctas"><a href="#podcast" class="btn btn-blue"><Icon name="play" />Listen to the podcast</a><a href="#press-contact" class="btn wq-ghost">Press inquiries</a></div>
          <HeroCreds />
          <p class="md-client">Looking for care for yourself or a loved one? <a class="inl" href="#insurance">Check your coverage</a>.</p>
        </div>
        <nav class="md-jump" aria-label="On this page">
          <p>On this page</p>
          <a href="#featured">As featured in<span>Six outlets</span></a>
          <a href="#podcast">Hope, Health &amp; Healing podcast<span>{PODCAST.length} episodes</span></a>
          <a href="#press">In the news<span>{press.length} features</span></a>
          <a href="#watch">Videos and TV segments<span>Watch here</span></a>
          <a href="#experts">Our experts<span>{experts.length} clinicians</span></a>
          <a href="#media-kit">Media kit<span>Logos and photos</span></a>
        </nav>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- 2. As featured in: each logo links to the live piece -->
    <section class="section is-white md-feat-sec" id="featured">
      <div class="container">
        <div class="sec-head"><h2>As featured in</h2><p class="lede">Outlets where Hopewell clinicians have appeared. Each logo opens the original piece.</p></div>
        <ul class="md-feat">
          {featured.map(([name, src, href]) => <li><a href={href} target="_blank" rel="noopener"><img src={src} alt={name} loading="lazy" /><span>{name}</span></a></li>)}
        </ul>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- 3. Podcast: navy split + episode table -->
    <section class="section is-navy" id="podcast">
      <div class="container md-pod">
        <div>
          <h2>Hope, Health &amp; Healing</h2>
          <p class="lede" style="margin-top:16px">A Hopewell Health Solutions series sharing real stories of mental health treatment and recovery, hosted by <a class="inl" href="/provider/tj-aitken-cpsrp/">TJ Aitken, CPSRP</a>.</p>
          <p style="margin-top:14px">Watch every episode on <a class="inl" href="/podcast/">our podcast page</a> or subscribe on the <a class="inl" href="https://www.youtube.com/@hopewellhealthsolutions2285" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Hopewell Health Solutions YouTube channel</a>.</p>
        </div>
        <button type="button" class="vc-card md-latest" data-yt={latest.yt} data-title={latest.title} aria-label={`Play: ${latest.title}`}>
          <span class="vc-poster"><img src={`/Assets/videos/${latest.img}.webp`} alt="" width="1280" height="720" loading="lazy" /><span class="vc-play"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="22" height="22" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M8 5.5v13l11-6.5z" fill="#fff"/></svg></span></span>
          <span class="md-latest-cap"><small>Latest episode · {latest.len}</small><strong>{latest.title}</strong></span>
        </button>
      </div>
      <div class="container">
        <div class="md-eps" role="table" aria-label="Podcast episodes">
          <div class="md-ep is-head" role="row"><span role="columnheader">Episode</span><span role="columnheader">Guest</span><span role="columnheader">Date</span><span role="columnheader">Length</span><span role="columnheader">Summary</span></div>
          {PODCAST.map((v) => (
            <div class="md-ep" role="row">
              <span role="cell"><strong>{v.type.replace("Podcast · ", "")}</strong></span>
              <span role="cell">{guestOf(v)}</span>
              <span role="cell">{new Date(v.date + "T12:00:00").toLocaleDateString("en-US", { month: "short", day: "numeric", year: "numeric" })}</span>
              <span role="cell">{v.len}</span>
              <span role="cell">{v.desc}</span>
            </div>
          ))}
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- 4. In the news -->
    <section class="section is-stone" id="press">
      <div class="container">
        <div class="sec-head"><h2>In the news</h2><p class="lede">Articles and features about Hopewell and our clinicians, each linking to the original source.</p></div>
        <div class="ab-press">
          {press.map((p) => (
            <a href={p.href} target="_blank" rel="noopener">
              <span class="ab-press-top">{p.logo ? <img src={p.logo} alt={p.outlet} loading="lazy" /> : <b>{p.outlet}</b>}<span>{p.date}</span></span>
              <strong>{p.title}</strong>
              {p.who && <span class="md-who">Featuring {p.who}</span>}
              <em>Read the feature <Icon name="arrow" class="h-4 w-4" /></em>
            </a>
          ))}
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <Prose blocks={blocks} />

    <!-- 5. Videos: TV segments + more from the team -->
    <section class="section is-stone" id="watch">
      <div class="container">
        <div class="sec-head"><h2>Interviews &amp; TV segments</h2><p class="lede">Press play to watch our clinicians on Connecticut TV.</p></div>
        <div class="ab-tv">
          {videos.map((v) => (
            <button type="button" class="vc-card" data-yt={v.id} data-title={v.t} aria-label={`Play: ${v.t}`}>
              <span class="vc-poster"><img src={POSTERS[v.id] ? `/Assets/videos/${POSTERS[v.id]}.webp` : `https://i.ytimg.com/vi/${v.id}/hqdefault.jpg`} alt="" width="1280" height="720" loading="lazy" /><span class="vc-play"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="22" height="22" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M8 5.5v13l11-6.5z" fill="#fff"/></svg></span></span>
              <span class="ab-tv-body"><small>{v.outlet}</small><strong>{v.t}</strong></span>
            </button>
          ))}
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>
    <VideoCarousel videos={more} mode="grid" heading="More From the Hopewell Team" lede="Our podcast and short videos from Hopewell clinicians." link={{ href: "/podcast/", label: "All podcast episodes" }} />

    <!-- 6. Our experts: divided 2 x 2 list -->
    <section class="section is-white" id="experts">
      <div class="container">
        <div class="sec-head"><h2>Our experts</h2><p class="lede">Clinicians who have spoken for Hopewell on TV, in print, on the podcast or in our videos. Each name links to a full bio, and <a class="inl" href="/about-us/team/">our team page</a> lists every clinician.</p></div>
        <ul class="md-experts">
          {experts.map(({ p, topics }) => (
            <li>
